{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:00:32Z","created_by_operation":"op_073bcd2adace4737a68a8e0dc571771f","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_146df6cec41291018df820854b62505b4b6ba2ff1453c7a394e9a653a72e9560","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"deep-copilot/deepcopilot@9ecbb66a50f2 snapshot a7bd145c95c3ea30","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_27373f37a145d150fc2dc89a6d182aa40cc6fb9bf38d883541f9efe4c0b945e2"],"source_ids":["src_2d3ac89f7cf45fd48910b31d035aa52e"],"text":"Architecture places everything in the VS Code extension host: extension.js entry, a ChatViewProvider with a webview message bus and per-session run map, a DeepSeek SSE API client, and a tools module with schema and exec files.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:00:32Z","updated_by_operation":"op_073bcd2adace4737a68a8e0dc571771f"}
